@codelaw/rules-tailwind

The rules are reimplementations written for codelaw. Their `ported_from:` fields
name the eslint-plugin-tailwindcss (https://github.com/francoismassart/eslint-plugin-tailwindcss,
MIT License) and eslint-plugin-better-tailwindcss
(https://github.com/schoero/eslint-plugin-better-tailwindcss, MIT License) rules
whose documented behaviour they reproduce; no code or documentation text of
either is included. No part of Tailwind CSS is included: the class table is
built at run time from the project's own `tailwindcss` by
@codelaw/provider-tailwind.
